{"id":"p3wmyr1rtb2pmyv9ejlb8j563","title":"小鼠胚胎二细胞期细胞核变软促进基因组激活","originalTitle":"新生命如何点火基因组？","summary":"2026年11月11日，《Nature》发表的研究发现，小鼠胚胎发育到二细胞期时，细胞核会暂时变软，这一变化与基因组激活密切相关。研究通过力学测量和分子干预证明，细胞核的机械性质影响基因表达。该发现有助于理解早期胚胎发育机制，并可能为辅助生殖技术提供新思路。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=248954&do=blog&id=1560920"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T08:36:31.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T14:38:14.636Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T14:38:14.636Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","Nature"],"score":36,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"3bfb87ee-af5d-4d8d-add4-c1c156ebae28","title":"《Nature》揭示小鼠胚胎二细胞期核变软与基因组激活关联"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"3bfb87ee-af5d-4d8d-add4-c1c156ebae28","title":"《Nature》揭示小鼠胚胎二细胞期核变软与基因组激活关联"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fC4DNWmRbp40","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}